n Resources Careers @ SUNY Cobleskill Faculty/Staff Student Employees Training Supervision & Hiring + Interview Exchange Information Search Committee Resources New Employee Onboarding Checklist × Human Resources Human Resources Careers @ SUNY Cobleskill Faculty/Staff Student Employees Training Supervision & Hiring + Interview Exchange Information Search Committee Resources New Employee Onboarding Checklist Contact Us Office of Human Resources Knapp Hall, Room 123 106 Suffolk Circle Cobleskill, NY 12043 518-255-5423 518-255-5657 Fax humanresources@cobleskill.edu Contact Us Office of Human Resources Knapp Hall, Room 123 106 Suffolk Circle Cobleskill, NY 12043 518-255-5423 518-255-5657 Fax humanresources@cobleskill.edu Some positions at SUNY Cobleskill accept applications on a continuous basis (i.e.:\n         whether a position is open or not) and retain the applications for up to two years. \n         Candidates may be contacted as positions become available. Other Continuous Recruitment Opportunities Your application remains active for two years. Applicants may reapply every six months,\n         if there is new information to add to your application. Please note, you may not be\n         contacted until a position becomes available and you are determined to be qualified. Looking for current openings in Faculty or Staff positions? Contact Us 106 Suffolk Circle Cobleskill, NY 12043 admissions@cobleskill.edu 518-255-5011 | 800-295-8988 Stay Connected facebook Link twitter Link instagram Link snapchat Link linkedin Link youtube Link © Quick Resources Campus Directory Campus Map & Directions Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Food Assistance Resources Careers at SUNY Cobleskill Hire SUNY Cobleskill Student Talent Privacy Policy Website Feedback Non-Discrimination/Title IX Campus Safety Information Access Student Right to Know Information Make a Gift to SUNY Cobleskill suny.edu © SUNY Cobleskill 2023 - All rights reserved."
